      "cooked": "<p>In Custom DocTypes, after we create a Document in that custom DocType, the user is able to edit the ID of the submitted Document. Is there a way to remove access for editing the ID?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.13 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f_2_690x272.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.13 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"xlgMniW3xfK2dXaQMOwGb7iSoyP\" width=\"690\" height=\"272\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f_2_690x272.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/9/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f_2_1035x408.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/9/e9af46f5be19632da4a7d9051eb03b5a011de71f.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"EDEEEE\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.13 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1192×470 73.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click on the Document ID</li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/1/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.34 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/1/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d_2_690x314.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.34 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"tV822lFor4wVGs9EdoGeXKLVuYl\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/1/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d_2_690x314.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/1/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d_2_1035x471.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/1/d1b446e5037ad7db257ec6c871adf8448830cd3d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-09-10 at 9.45.34 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1166×532 41.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n2. Rename the Document ID</p>\n<p>I want to disable the “ID Editing” feature that for custom DocType. How to do that?</p>",
