      "id": 480391,
      "username": "avc",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:06:39.662Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi:</p>\n<p>Just disable “Allow rename” on your doctype.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/c/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3_2_690x239.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"te2xVQLq2HMqYbGkp8fwRGKdb1h\" width=\"690\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3_2_690x239.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3_2_1035x358.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/c/ccd55ebf08986801fe88d6ca55d9e11e94b6d1f3_2_1380x478.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8F6\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1665×578 21.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>If you are customizing existing doctype try using Property Setter.</p>\n<p>Hope this helps.</p>",
